source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
List all data models

Usage: vendo models list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --type <type>     Filter by data type
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --valid           Only show valid models
      --invalid         Only show invalid models
      --limit <n>       Number of results [default: 20]
      --offset <n>      Pagination offset [default: 0]
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --output <field>  Print a single field per row (e.g. id, name)
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo models list
  $ vendo models list --valid
  $ vendo models list --output id
